-- PlanGrant — an entitlement grant within a plan step: what's granted,
-- optional start time, optional payload.
--
-- Static rows: none. The pre-flip inline-TS `defineSystemEntity` is GONE.
--
-- FM-retire-E1 Step 6 — LABEL-LESS entity; the bare `@codeName "PlanGrant"`
-- trips the loader's identity-facet gate (see ButtonPayload.fenel).
-- `payload: Maybe ({})` needs parens (compound `{}` arg). Referenced by
-- PlanStep.grants (`List PlanGrant`) — the lazy name-ref resolves via the
-- catalog at use, so load-array order is irrelevant.

@entity
@codeName "PlanGrant"
PlanGrant = PlanGrant entitlement: NonEmptyStr startAt: Maybe String payload: Maybe ({})
